  "_comment": "Shipped labels for the built-in schema, per DOCUMENT language. Not the app UI strings (those are ARB files in lib/l10n/arb). Adding a language here is a data-only change: add the locale code to each entry. Anything missing falls back to English. Reviewable without reading code.",
